# Strobe x PCHI demo — Only-Lang rules
#
# The Strobe bridge forwards Strobe's "strobe_intensity" control (a 0..1
# value, exactly as Strobe's OSC feedback reports it) as control parameter
# strobe.strobe_intensity. A denial here lowers Show Confidence in Mission
# Control for 60 s and is signed into the governance log.
#
# The 0.8 threshold is the same placeholder as demos/multi-tool-live-show,
# not a vetted safety limit — see PRICING.md on certified rule packs.

harmony(1e-12)

if strobe.strobe_intensity > 0.8 then
    deny("Strobe intensity exceeds venue safety limit")
end

# Transition rule (mentions show.entering, so it is judged when a state is
# about to be entered and never on ordinary updates). A department that has
# never reported reads "unknown", which is not "ready".
if show.entering == "FINALE" and readiness.lasers != "ready" then
    deny("FINALE requires lasers to be ready")
end
